							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							In the days that I&#039;ve played, they were the best out there.&nbsp; Given the game has been &quot;dummy downed&quot; to the likings of a casual player...I do believe they would excel today.<br /><br />War - Dyvim --no contest here<br />Pal - Polonious --best mage healer in the game.&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/approve.gif" alt="approve" border="0" /><br />SK- Bagbok --don&#039;t know too many sk&#039;s out there<br />Bard- Asian&nbsp; --most people probably don&#039;t know him<br />Ranger- Keeneye --no contest<br />Shaman- Dwilgar --not too many shaman out there either...but more than likely Reia (sp?) or some other old alliance shaman would rival Dwilgar.<br />Monk- Kimdoohan&nbsp; --Satao might challange his rank at #1.<br />Enchanter -Neckrodeemus&nbsp; --won the best echanter contest back in the day...mad skills.<br />Wiz- Milfranic --probably the most influential wizard back in the day, ton of suggestions back on the old sony/eq board.&nbsp; &nbsp;As far as skills go.&nbsp; There was one other wizard in AoD, drawing a blank on his name...quiet guy and extremely intelligen...quit a long time ago.<br /><br /><br />Posted on: October 21, 2004, 10:09:23 pmPosted by: Ssnakess&nbsp; <br />
