								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=991.msg12238#msg12238">Re: Rodcet Nife Allstars</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #218 on:</b> October 30, 2004, 12:24:55 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Aellis soloed Trak so early in EQ that even the other druids at EQ Druids and The Druids Grove accused her of lying when no one on any other server could do it.&nbsp; She had to go do it AGAIN and post screenshots before anyone took her seriously.&nbsp; And Delheru is right.&nbsp; This is at a time when she was the somewhere between the 3rd to 5th best equipped druid on RN, behind Katia, myself, and maybe Kiladen and Tilien, although not sure of the last 2.&nbsp; While its hard to quanify druids from a grouping and raiding perspective (we have oh so much to offer that stands out), its is quite easy to quantify soloing druids.&nbsp; And in the History of RN, there has never been anyone as good as Aellis.<br /><br />Fenani
						</td>
